<h2>3. Why we process it</h2><p>We use this data only to provide the Service: to create clips and to publish them to your connected account when you request it (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR). Technical data is processed to keep the Service secure (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</p>
