<h2>5. Storage and deletion</h2><p>Access tokens are stored securely and used only to publish content you request. Videos and clips are deleted after processing unless you keep them. You can revoke ViralClipper's access at any time in your TikTok settings under "Security &gt; Manage app permissions"; we then delete your tokens and account data.</p>
<h2>6. Your rights</h2><p>Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection. You can also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority. To exercise your rights, contact us at the email above.</p>
<h2>7. Third-party platforms</h2><p>When you publish content, the respective platform's privacy policy applies, e.g. the <a href="https://www.tiktok.com/legal/privacy-policy-eea">TikTok Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
